# Godot generated files
.godot/
*.import
# The character GLB needs its tuned import settings committed so every
# fresh checkout / CI import keeps all pose-keyed animation channels:
!assets/characters/human/human_male.glb.import
# Embedded textures re-extracted by the glTF importer on every fresh import:
assets/characters/human/human_male_*.png

